Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.39,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Coming for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:02:00.49,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was do right things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:05.55,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to be the king, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:10.37,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was save your life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.37,0:02:16.00,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to grab a knife, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:23.53,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Tearless, fearless, burning, burning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:26.78,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}You tell me what have I missed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:30.70,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Still wandering in the deep mist
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:36.56,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, slip and fall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:39.29,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I will never look away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.56,0:02:45.29,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:49.39,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all outside the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:52.58,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Live to die another day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:55.11,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I don’t want anything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.35,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I’m just here to…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:01.92,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Beware
